Thanks for the fixes - the definition still contains some errors:

```json
  "security": [
    {
      "BasicAuth": [
        "[]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Token": [
        "[]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "AccessToken": [
        "[]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "AuthorizationHeaderToken": [
        "[]"
      ]
    }
  ]
```

The scopes arrays themselves should be empty, they should not contain strings with the value `[]`.
